    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.poster.avif?t=1755088815\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.webm?t=1755088815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.mp4?t=1755088815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadowy alleys of Arousbach, a city where new prohibition laws try to lock away certain pleasures, a tucked-away pastry shop offers more than meets the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Night Dessert</i></strong> is a cozy, narrative-driven visual novel where you play as a nocturnal bartender in a mysterious, late-night dessert shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, guests arrive. Humans, vampires, werewolves, and other nighttime souls, each with their own stories, desires, and confessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What they reveal depends on what you say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wrapped in a jazz-filled atmosphere, Night Dessert is all about conversation, connection, and the strange beauty of the night.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/33c3b6da0157e75f1b7f39da4d339150.poster.avif?t=1755088815\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/33c3b6da0157e75f1b7f39da4d339150.webp?t=1755088815\" class=\"bb_img\" width=745 height=385 /></picture></span>\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.poster.avif?t=1755088815\" width=600 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.webm?t=1755088815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/24ea494b228307a60d7f2681ba5069e7.mp4?t=1755088815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the shadowy alleys of Arousbach, a city where new prohibition laws try to lock away certain pleasures, a tucked-away pastry shop offers more than meets the eye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Night Dessert</i></strong> is a cozy, narrative-driven visual novel where you play as a nocturnal bartender in a mysterious, late-night dessert shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, guests arrive. Humans, vampires, werewolves, and other nighttime souls, each with their own stories, desires, and confessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What they reveal depends on what you say.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wrapped in a jazz-filled atmosphere, Night Dessert is all about conversation, connection, and the strange beauty of the night.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/33c3b6da0157e75f1b7f39da4d339150.poster.avif?t=1755088815\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397770/extras/33c3b6da0157e75f1b7f39da4d339150.webp?t=1755088815\" class=\"bb_img\" width=745 height=385 /></picture></span>\u00a0</p>",
